      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Respiratory feedback is to be seen as an apparatus aided psychotherapy. Like other hypnoide psychotherapies it acts via the vegetative switch, enabling relaxation and dynamization, as well as intentional formula. Administration in a semi open group can be demonstrated within the frame work of neuro-rehabilitations, mainly pain-rehabilitation. The action is to be seen as well somatotropic as psychotropic, within a holistic approach."},
